        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Matte Black Hunner 36 Inch Door Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Hunner 36 Inch Door Pull in Matte Black are as sleek as they are stunning. Their minimalist look is perfect for modern spaces. The Matte Black Hunner 36 Inch Door Handle is available in surface mounting, back to back mounting, and thru-bolt mounting. This Mitered Door Pull is 36-3/4 inches long with 36 inch mounting centers. It can be installed on commercial or residential doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNeed a different size?  <a href=\"/products/hunner-24-inch-door-pull-in-matte-black\"><b>24 Hunner Inch Door Pull</b></a>,  <a href=\"/products/hunner-48-inch-door-pull-in-matte-black\"><b>48\" Hunner Inch Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/hunner-60-inch-door-pull-in-matte-black\"><b>60\" Hunner Inch Door Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/hunner-72-inch-door-pull-in-matte-black\"><b>72\" Hunner Inch Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rectangular Doorware Designs RTMPULL36-622:\r\n<ul>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\"></a>\r\n<li>Material: 304 Grade Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Matte Black</b></li> \r\n<li>Total Length: 36-3/4\" (934mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 36\" (9140mm) C/C</li>\r\n<li>Grip Width: 1-1/2\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors up to 3\" thick</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed on fiberglass, wood, glass, and metal doors.\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-RTMPULL36-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262424\"><b>DWD-RTMPULL36 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Hunner 36 Inch Door Pull in Matte Black",
                "description": "The Hunner 36 Inch Door Pull in Matte Black are as sleek as they are stunning. Their minimalist look is perfect for modern spaces. The Matte Black Hunner 36 Inch Door Handle is available in surface mounting, back to back mounting, and thru-bolt mounting. This Mitered Door Pull is 36-3/4 inches long with 36 inch mounting centers. It can be installed on commercial or residential doors.",
